### 健康检查 / 会话状态
GET http://localhost:8080/api/quant/health

### 当前 jar 实际能力（对照接口文档）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/quant/capabilities

### 查询 init 状态
GET http://localhost:8080/api/quant/init/status

### 列出内置样例
GET http://localhost:8080/api/quant/samples

### 读取 CNY FR007 任务样例
GET http://localhost:8080/api/quant/samples/task-cny-fr007

### 仅解析任务 JSON，不执行计算
POST http://localhost:8080/api/quant/workflow/parse?mode=TASK
Content-Type: application/json

< ../src/main/resources/samples/task-cny-fr007.json

### 装载曲线配方
POST http://localhost:8080/api/quant/init/build-recipe
Content-Type: application/json

< ../src/main/resources/samples/init-build-recipe.json

### 装载日历
POST http://localhost:8080/api/quant/init/calendar
Content-Type: application/json

< ../src/main/resources/samples/init-calendar.json

### 装载惯例
POST http://localhost:8080/api/quant/init/conventions
Content-Type: application/json

< ../src/main/resources/samples/init-conventions.json

### 封板 init，此后才能 run
POST http://localhost:8080/api/quant/init/finished

### 执行 flat 单任务
POST http://localhost:8080/api/quant/run/task
Content-Type: application/json

< ../src/main/resources/samples/task-cny-fr007.json

### 重置 init（需要重新装载配置时）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/quant/init/reset

### 一次性 init + run（推荐联调入口）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/quant/run/oneshot
Content-Type: application/json

< ../src/main/resources/samples/oneshot-cny-fr007.json

### 使用服务内置样例一键跑通
POST http://localhost:8080/api/quant/run/oneshot/sample/cny-fr007
